.TH "Docv::CrystalPages::Shard" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::CrystalPages::Shard \- The shard being documented: its root, name, version, and the \fB\%require\fR that loads each source file.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::CrystalPages::Shard\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The shard being documented: its root, name, version, and the \fB\%require\fR
that loads each source file.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.PP
\fBMANIFEST = "shard.yml"\fR
.PP
\fBREQUIRE = /\eA\es*require\es+"(\e.\e.?\e/[\(ha"]+)"/\fR
.PP
\fBVERSION_LINE = /\eAversion:\es*["\(aq]?([\(ha\es"\(aq]+)/\fR
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(root : String, name : String)\fR
.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.root(dir : String) : String | Nil\fR
The nearest directory from \fIdir\fR up that holds a \fB\%shard.yml\fR.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef name : String\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef relative(text : String) : String\fR
\fItext\fR with the shard\(aqs absolute path made relative, so pages built
on any machine are identical.
.TP 4
\fBdef require_path(type : TypeDoc) : String | Nil\fR
The \fB\%require\fR that loads \fItype\fR, from the first entry file that
reaches one of its source files.
.PP
\fBdef root : String\fR
.PP
\fBdef version : String | Nil\fR
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/crystal_pages/model.cr
